each.\n\n4. **Trainer Profile**\n\n   You agree to create a truthful and accurate trainer profile, including but not limited to your qualifications, experience, and areas of expertise.\n\n5. **Payment Terms**\n\n   ByteXL may offer compensation or benefits to trainers. Details about payment terms, including rates, payment schedules, and payment methods, will be provided separately and are subject to change.\n\n6. **Content Guidelines**\n\n   You are responsible for the content you provide on the platform, including profile information, course materials, and any communication with users. Content must adhere to ethical standards and not violate any laws or intellectual property rights.\n\n7. **User Interaction**\n\n   Interactions with students or other users should be professional and respectful. ByteXL reserves the right to suspend or terminate your account if there is evidence of harassment, discrimination, or inappropriate behavior.\n\n8. **Termination**\n\n   ByteXL reserves the right to terminate or suspend your account at any time for violations of these terms, at our discretion.\n\n9. **Intellectual Property**\n\n   You retain ownership of the content you create. By providing content on ByteXL, you grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide license to use, display, and distribute your content on the platform.\n\n10. **Changes to Terms**\n\n    We reserve the right to modify or revise these terms at any time. Continued use of the service after such changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.\n\n"})}),(0,p.jsxs)(j.A,{children:[(0,p.jsx)(B.A,{onClick:_,color:"primary",children:"Decline"}),(0,p.jsx)(B.A,{onClick:()=>{c("tncSelected",!0),y()},color:"primary",autoFocus:!0,children:"I Accept"})]})]}),f&&f[r]&&m&&m[r]&&(0,p.jsx)(U.A,{error:!0,id:"standard-weight - helper - text - ".concat(r," "),children:m[r]})]})};var _e=n(25560),be=n(30467),xe=n(47843),Se=(n(70318),n(84458));const we={_id:"",name:"",email:"",phone:"",phoneSecondary:"",gender:"female",demoVideo:"",pict